            <div xml:id="m-7c4e5005-3057-455f-a2b6-c1eb9eeed9b3">
              <lg xml:id="m-a8677acf-b37e-49ee-bcab-b810086f699e">
                <l xml:id="m-202c1c2b-699e-4775-a12e-1f28bc6c6237" facs="#m-391d5a5d-6c66-4774-a001-07baa59ba5f3" label="ambiguous">172</l><l xml:id="m-ba85a123-c926-44d9-ac60-c5701a8c98d8" facs="#m-51c019df-0b31-4d8b-9f16-e4885517529e" label="ambiguous">Laetatus sum. 6. F. — 7. a, b, c, c", d.</l><l xml:id="m-ea66f97a-2c95-480c-baec-540c7af8af77" facs="#m-089a23ea-883c-4e1c-8c93-25d6ab672465" label="lyrics-like">6. Rogáte quae ad pácem sunt /erúsalem:“et abundántia dillgén¬</l><l xml:id="m-a230cd3c-6d8c-45e7-b21a-666bfdad1f46" facs="#m-912fdbff-7659-4f2f-8920-cbfdd76172ee" label="ambiguous">tibus te.</l><l xml:id="m-fd8a9602-2997-4d8e-b4ee-1d3429be1aea" facs="#m-fa41f59b-6b46-4edc-9764-44ecc86f7b2b" label="lyrics-like">7. Fiat pax in virtúte túa:“et abundántia in turribus túis¬</l><l xml:id="m-2a6025a1-9072-495e-af63-99b12f9bde15" facs="#m-3dffbc57-4ca7-411f-a355-8ef318738e21" label="lyrics-like">8. Propter frâtres méos et próximos méos, * loquébar pácem de te:</l><l xml:id="m-cc2e6416-bbbf-476f-ad0a-6699520439ad" facs="#m-17ef51eb-1d83-4031-ba37-360bbdae9a68" label="lyrics-like">9. Propter dómum Dómini Dét nóstri, * quaesivi bóna tibi.</l><l xml:id="m-88b5a17f-9949-4a82-a1ac-f7149a16dae6" facs="#m-72f2b978-d0db-47d2-afd0-e915d1351661" label="lyrics-like">10. Glória Pâtri, et Filio, "et Spirttui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-0ca356f8-79a4-42a0-b9c9-d86e0691cae4" facs="#m-883534be-4027-4708-b1fc-2ca75765ddf2" label="lyrics-like">11. Sicut érat in princípio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saccu¬</l><l xml:id="m-3569366b-2d0a-454e-99af-0f5ab897c7cc" facs="#m-abbe075d-ce18-4e8d-a08c-2249203bd028" label="lyrics-like">tórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-1af2a8dc-7433-46db-a3bd-8a74ff524bb1" facs="#m-857f3b23-de37-4e90-a037-00ecd8f51a17" label="ambiguous">Tone G. F.</l><l xml:id="m-2f2d236a-fbe9-4971-8071-0120915ed29a" facs="#m-28fe748d-eebd-4ebf-8ee0-3b0408b63d50" label="text-like">Mediant of r accent with I preparatory Ending of 1 accent with a prepara¬</l><l xml:id="m-4277723d-5fa6-4374-8a63-362238f67c97" facs="#m-ffc4fc11-98a8-4b8f-9110-f417b1a96055" label="ambiguous">"llable</l><l xml:id="m-3ed535fc-caf4-4ae2-965b-dcfe048a32db" facs="#m-588fa04b-db9f-488d-a271-96c11801cb8f" label="ambiguous">tory syllables</l><l xml:id="m-4c15057f-cd20-4ec1-a432-561d22440f72" facs="#m-96a9b61e-c563-422b-b306-1c9e064b3b65" label="lyrics-like">1. Laetátus sum in his quae dícta sunt mi¬i:*In dómum Dómint</l><l xml:id="m-5923f855-0073-428f-b096-5028b5d1dd41" facs="#m-fca05cce-f6fb-48ba-9611-86f82da3b1a1" label="ambiguous">ibimus.</l><l xml:id="m-0904dc88-5198-41e1-916f-ffa9fd7f36fa" facs="#m-691ba56e-5486-4249-82e6-8bb0d773a539" label="lyrics-like">2. Stántes érant pédes nóstri, * in átriis túis /erúsalem.</l><l xml:id="m-834b4860-25a7-4fb0-8017-46cb7ebfc18c" facs="#m-1c3ed309-d7c9-4b67-942d-c51d463b8ca1" label="lyrics-like">3. Jerúsalem, quae aedificátur ut civitas:*cújus participátio éjus in</l><l xml:id="m-f1a5b740-62f3-4bfd-bd2e-12523fba1627" facs="#m-19da48af-dfbd-46a7-8bdd-a4b4a1574d82" label="ambiguous">taipsum.</l><l xml:id="m-1abb2f6d-b89d-4c2e-a03e-a61c4f5dcd73" facs="#m-01ed376b-cbb6-434e-b692-5858718cd40f" label="lyrics-like">4. Illuc enim ascendérunt tribus, trious Dómini:"*testimónium Israel</l><l xml:id="m-608c1fd2-deab-4e57-ad3a-8c5ba2cfde66" facs="#m-dfd0385e-28c6-4862-a9ad-9f50ef69c9ce" label="lyrics-like">ad confiténdum nómint Dómini.</l><l xml:id="m-1f1e4795-98c3-4923-8f07-a4639a21ffe1" facs="#m-41580fa3-6a14-4733-b713-7dbecc1d1dd3" label="lyrics-like">5. Quia illic sedérunt sédes in judicio, * sédes super dómum Dávid.</l><l xml:id="m-3284ca70-a4ba-4ccf-ab86-c8d6eafad977" facs="#m-6e723a0b-57f3-436d-a9b7-036678ec0476" label="lyrics-like">6. Rogáte quae ad pâcem sunt ferúsalem:“et abundántia diligén¬</l><l xml:id="m-2b830f04-cbed-4c2c-9385-045fe3ba6154" facs="#m-28ba6287-78b0-4415-a56d-d0c4a8057c5c" label="ambiguous">tibus te.</l><l xml:id="m-d68c93ba-4ca4-491b-97f0-b4e9180257ed" facs="#m-f7245ea6-8ab0-4bab-b0a6-8dcda7065ee4" label="lyrics-like">7. Fíat pax in virtúte túa:“et abundántia in túrribus túis.</l><l xml:id="m-386bf441-a88b-46e4-9608-5756781c571c" facs="#m-7c1d54fc-5519-45ed-9da9-d3fcf0c3f3d6" label="lyrics-like">8. Propter frâtres méos et próximos méos, *loquébar pácem de te:</l><l xml:id="m-0c315c04-2363-49a4-8c0e-2be93e063c89" facs="#m-cc7ac031-c98b-44c9-8d5a-c99e9ab004b2" label="lyrics-like">9. Propter dómum Dómini Dét nóstri, * quaesívi bóna tíbi.</l><l xml:id="m-b2c93d40-2a2c-487f-8b82-74aa5e3357ad" facs="#m-5a1ac32d-f5a1-4f83-82d8-095824010bf8" label="lyrics-like">10. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-22cd411d-4b75-41bd-9094-8d4713da135c" facs="#m-7660b090-b4c6-4eeb-a76c-a87627be37da" label="lyrics-like">11. Sicut érat in princípio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-d9689945-d659-41e3-824e-8a0abd805139" facs="#m-9ca700e6-4475-4162-892d-34fb7a95736c" label="lyrics-like">tórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-30e90a1f-a289-460b-abe3-2722627ec676" facs="#m-205d7c6c-3297-4c19-862b-17d9712aca10" label="ambiguous">Tone 7. a, b, e, ce, d.</l><l xml:id="m-96e0ac6e-7408-4604-9496-0df15aa2c345" facs="#m-0464c67a-9e21-4689-b52f-cb4f81fd49ad" label="text-like">Mediant of z accents</l><l xml:id="m-ed0c7c29-e1e2-4d74-b212-08102b127d35" facs="#m-5abcbf46-979f-40f0-a992-c553e7df89d6" label="text-like">Endings of z accenta</l><l xml:id="m-bb80b3f8-48b5-4a63-8572-f16f141e58a3" facs="#m-401f0436-78dc-4636-9f6c-1f2ba6848bc7" label="lyrics-like">1.Laetátus sum in his quae dicta sunt mi¬ hi:*In dómum Dómini</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
